--[[
	UI
	--
	The hub panel. A single docked side panel with four views:

	  Drive  build/spawn, live telemetry, controls reference, event log
	  Build  mesh roles, wheel layout editor with a live 3D preview of the chassis
	  Tune   presets, sectioned parameters with sliders, derived read-outs, expert overrides
	  Link   server connection status

	Visual language: warm graphite surfaces, one signal-orange accent, BuilderSans for text
	and RobotoMono for numbers. Motion is short (120-350 ms) quint easing; nothing bounces.
]]

